# public/ is served verbatim by Vercel, whose builds do not fetch LFS objects:
# anything stored there as an LFS pointer ships to users as ~130 bytes of
# pointer text (this broke /icon.svg, /icons/**, and the ESMS token icons that
# on-chain SPL metadata links to). Keep every public asset a regular blob.
# Guarded by src/__tests__/publicAssetsAreRealBytes.test.ts.
public/** !filter !diff !merge
